# The v0.5 expression layer: Text is no longer opaque inside a lambda —
# startswith, indexof, slice and upper all read into it without dropping
# back to the pipeline layer.
Cursed Energy: stdin
Cursed Technique: Split Text by "\n"
Maximum Technique: Count Matching
    Using: (s) -> startswith(s, "ab") or indexof(s, "zq") > 0 or upper(slice(s, 0, 3)) = "XYZ"
Reveal: stdout
